00:06:00.126 --> 00:06:03.130 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Jean-François a dit quelque

00:06:01.161 --> 00:06:04.164 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chose d'important: sauver la

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:06.466 size:53% position:73% line:53%
face, permettre à Poutine de

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:07.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sauver la face. Posez-vous la

00:06:04.264 --> 00:06:08.935 size:53% position:73% line:53%
question qu'est-ce que ça veut

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:11.972 size:53% position:73% line:53%
