00:08:42.656 --> 00:08:45.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour beaucoup, il n'y a qu'une

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:49.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
seule façon de finir ce conflit-

00:08:45.058 --> 00:08:50.130 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là; c'est la disparition de

00:08:46.059 --> 00:08:51.164 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Vladimir Poutine, si pas sa

00:08:49.229 --> 00:08:52.198 size:53% position:73% line:53%
